{"book": "MRK", "chapter": 14, "lang": "es", "bible": "RV1909-2026", "engine": "chatterbox-videos-v1", "durationMs": 578506, "verses": [{"verse": 1, "start": 300, "end": 11678, "text": "Y dos días después era la Pascua y la fiesta de los panes sin levadura: y buscaban los principales sacerdotes y los escribas cómo le prenderían con engaño, y le matarían.", "words": [[0, 300], [2, 426], [6, 606], [11, 906], [19, 1306], [23, 1766], [26, 2116], [33, 2466], [35, 2526], [38, 2606], [45, 3006], [48, 3146], [52, 3286], [58, 3826], [62, 3966], [72, 5027], [74, 5132], [83, 5632], [87, 5772], [99, 6452], [110, 7152], [112, 7292], [116, 7432], [125, 8052], [130, 8612], [133, 8832], [144, 9472], [148, 9652], [156, 10292], [158, 10772], [161, 10872]]}, {"verse": 2, "start": 12028, "end": 16746, "text": "Y decían: No en el día de la fiesta, porque no se haga alboroto del pueblo.", "words": [[0, 12028], [2, 12250], [10, 13229], [13, 13410], [16, 13570], [19, 13670], [23, 13830], [26, 13950], [29, 14050], [37, 14790], [44, 14990], [47, 15170], [50, 15370], [55, 15710], [64, 16050], [68, 16210]]}, {"verse": 3, "start": 17026, "end": 32903, "text": "Y estando él en Betania en casa de Simón el leproso, y sentado a la mesa, vino una mujer teniendo un frasco de alabastro con perfume de nardo puro muy costoso; y rompiendo el frasco, se lo derramó sobre su cabeza.", "words": [[0, 17026], [2, 17190], [10, 17710], [13, 18090], [16, 18370], [24, 19190], [27, 19290], [32, 19530], [35, 19750], [41, 20405], [44, 20525], [53, 21545], [55, 21645], [63, 22125], [65, 22205], [68, 22285], [74, 23009], [79, 23295], [83, 23575], [89, 23915], [98, 24490], [101, 24630], [108, 25070], [111, 25190], [121, 25750], [125, 25950], [133, 26450], [136, 26710], [142, 27150], [147, 27530], [151, 27770], [160, 28817], [162, 28942], [172, 29562], [175, 29742], [183, 30762], [186, 31042], [189, 31182], [197, 31742], [203, 32002], [206, 32202]]}, {"verse": 4, "start": 33253, "end": 39681, "text": "Y hubo algunos que se enojaron dentro de sí, y dijeron: ¿Para qué se ha hecho este desperdicio de perfume?", "words": [[0, 33253], [2, 33534], [7, 33834], [15, 34194], [19, 34434], [22, 34594], [31, 35194], [38, 35494], [41, 35794], [45, 36034], [47, 36274], [56, 37236], [62, 37398], [66, 37578], [69, 37758], [72, 37878], [78, 38058], [83, 38298], [95, 38898], [98, 39018]]}, {"verse": 5, "start": 40031, "end": 46820, "text": "Porque podía esto ser vendido por más de trescientos denarios, y darse a los pobres. Y murmuraban contra ella.", "words": [[0, 40031], [7, 40196], [13, 40576], [18, 40856], [22, 41096], [30, 41556], [34, 41776], [38, 41936], [41, 42206], [53, 42476], [63, 43236], [65, 43461], [71, 43821], [73, 43881], [77, 44001], [85, 44887], [87, 45012], [98, 45792], [105, 46252]]}, {"verse": 6, "start": 47170, "end": 53481, "text": "Pero Jesús dijo: Dejadla; ¿por qué la molestáis? Ha hecho una buena obra conmigo;", "words": [[0, 47170], [5, 47320], [11, 47660], [17, 48707], [26, 49703], [31, 49828], [35, 49968], [38, 50088], [49, 51398], [52, 51659], [58, 51859], [62, 52039], [68, 52279], [73, 52599]]}, {"verse": 7, "start": 53831, "end": 62144, "text": "Que siempre tendréis los pobres con vosotros, y cuando queráis les podréis hacer bien; pero a mí no siempre me tendréis.", "words": [[0, 53831], [4, 53913], [12, 54333], [21, 55073], [25, 55233], [32, 55773], [36, 56033], [46, 56633], [48, 57093], [55, 57313], [63, 57933], [67, 58273], [75, 58993], [81, 59313], [87, 60161], [92, 60304], [94, 60444], [97, 60584], [100, 60724], [108, 61004], [111, 61304]]}, {"verse": 8, "start": 62494, "end": 69103, "text": "Esta ha hecho lo que podía; porque se ha anticipado a ungir mi cuerpo para la sepultura.", "words": [[0, 62494], [5, 62830], [8, 63170], [14, 63490], [17, 63670], [21, 63810], [28, 64750], [35, 64954], [38, 65194], [41, 65354], [52, 66534], [54, 66824], [60, 67114], [63, 67334], [70, 67674], [75, 67994], [78, 68154]]}, {"verse": 9, "start": 69453, "end": 80350, "text": "De cierto os digo que dondequiera que se predique este evangelio en todo el mundo, también se contará, en memoria de esta mujer, lo que ella ha hecho.", "words": [[0, 69453], [3, 69659], [10, 70059], [13, 70459], [18, 70859], [22, 71519], [34, 72179], [38, 72379], [41, 72539], [50, 73159], [55, 73539], [65, 74279], [68, 74399], [73, 74659], [76, 74879], [83, 75599], [91, 75859], [94, 76179], [103, 76759], [106, 77279], [114, 77779], [117, 77999], [122, 78219], [129, 78619], [132, 79059], [136, 79199], [141, 79479], [144, 79799]]}, {"verse": 10, "start": 80700, "end": 88627, "text": "Entonces Judas Iscariote, uno de los doce, vino a los príncipes de los sacerdotes, para entregársele.", "words": [[0, 80700], [9, 81702], [15, 82142], [26, 83122], [30, 83362], [33, 83502], [37, 83642], [43, 84462], [48, 84702], [50, 84862], [54, 84982], [64, 85702], [67, 85822], [71, 85942], [83, 86702], [88, 87698]]}, {"verse": 11, "start": 88977, "end": 97291, "text": "Y ellos al oírlo se alegraron, y prometieron que le darían dinero. Y buscaba oportunidad cómo le entregaría.", "words": [[0, 88977], [2, 89143], [8, 89483], [11, 89643], [17, 90423], [20, 90543], [31, 91263], [33, 91623], [45, 92283], [49, 92463], [52, 92583], [59, 93023], [67, 94003], [69, 94129], [77, 94629], [89, 95509], [94, 96089], [97, 96269]]}, {"verse": 12, "start": 97641, "end": 110195, "text": "Y el primer día de los panes sin levadura, cuando sacrificaban el cordero pascual, sus discípulos le dicen: ¿Dónde quieres que vayamos a preparar para que comas la pascua?", "words": [[0, 97641], [2, 97774], [5, 97894], [12, 98314], [16, 98694], [19, 98874], [23, 99014], [29, 99574], [33, 99974], [43, 101214], [50, 101594], [63, 102574], [66, 102694], [74, 103584], [83, 104474], [87, 104674], [98, 105634], [101, 106034], [108, 106854], [115, 107131], [123, 107471], [127, 107691], [135, 108111], [137, 108251], [146, 108771], [151, 108951], [155, 109131], [161, 109491], [164, 109591]]}, {"verse": 13, "start": 110475, "end": 120333, "text": "Y envía dos de sus discípulos, y les dice: Id a la ciudad, y os encontrará un hombre que lleva un cántaro de agua; seguidle;", "words": [[0, 110475], [2, 110617], [8, 111058], [12, 111598], [15, 112078], [19, 112298], [31, 113058], [33, 113338], [37, 113518], [43, 114324], [46, 114418], [48, 114511], [51, 114651], [59, 115531], [61, 115811], [64, 115931], [75, 116691], [78, 116871], [85, 117171], [89, 117371], [95, 117631], [98, 117871], [106, 118491], [109, 118731], [115, 119538]]}, {"verse": 14, "start": 120683, "end": 129721, "text": "Y donde entre, decid al señor de la casa: El Maestro dice: ¿Dónde está el aposento donde he de comer la pascua con mis discípulos?", "words": [[0, 120683], [2, 120940], [8, 121180], [15, 122120], [21, 122580], [24, 122800], [30, 123099], [33, 123340], [36, 123459], [42, 124230], [45, 124368], [53, 124888], [59, 125764], [66, 126090], [71, 126330], [74, 126470], [83, 127010], [89, 127250], [92, 127470], [95, 127590], [101, 127830], [104, 128160], [111, 128490], [115, 128610], [119, 128810]]}, {"verse": 15, "start": 130071, "end": 136891, "text": "Y él os mostrará una gran habitación superior ya preparada: preparad para nosotros allí.", "words": [[0, 130071], [2, 130218], [5, 130378], [8, 130598], [17, 131458], [21, 131618], [26, 131878], [37, 132478], [46, 132958], [49, 133358], [60, 134816], [69, 135444], [74, 135784], [83, 136164]]}, {"verse": 16, "start": 137241, "end": 144185, "text": "Y fueron sus discípulos, y vinieron a la ciudad, y hallaron como les había dicho; y prepararon la pascua.", "words": [[0, 137241], [2, 137362], [9, 137602], [13, 137942], [25, 138702], [27, 138882], [36, 139282], [38, 139442], [41, 139522], [49, 139882], [51, 140202], [60, 140682], [65, 140962], [69, 141162], [75, 141482], [82, 142314], [84, 142423], [95, 143103], [98, 143343]]}, {"verse": 17, "start": 144535, "end": 146874, "text": "Y llegada la tarde, fue con los doce.", "words": [[0, 144535], [2, 144644], [10, 145024], [13, 145184], [20, 145504], [24, 145844], [28, 146064], [32, 146499]]}, {"verse": 18, "start": 147224, "end": 156030, "text": "Y como se sentaron a la mesa y comiesen, dice Jesús: De cierto os digo que uno de vosotros, que come conmigo, me ha de entregar.", "words": [[0, 147224], [2, 147348], [7, 147648], [10, 147868], [19, 148468], [21, 148608], [24, 148688], [29, 148968], [31, 149128], [41, 149988], [46, 150308], [53, 151248], [56, 151392], [63, 151732], [66, 152112], [71, 152432], [75, 152652], [79, 152852], [82, 153012], [92, 153532], [96, 153952], [101, 154212], [110, 154892], [113, 155212], [116, 155292], [119, 155412]]}, {"verse": 19, "start": 156380, "end": 165035, "text": "Entonces ellos comenzaron a entristecerse, y a decirle cada uno por sí: ¿ Seré yo? Y el otro: ¿ Seré yo?", "words": [[0, 156380], [9, 156943], [15, 157423], [26, 158243], [28, 158383], [43, 159463], [45, 160083], [47, 160183], [55, 160763], [60, 161023], [64, 161443], [68, 161743], [72, 162382], [74, 162382], [79, 162724], [83, 163337], [85, 163518], [88, 163638], [94, 164360], [96, 164360], [101, 164702]]}, {"verse": 20, "start": 165315, "end": 170948, "text": "Y él respondiendo les dijo: Es uno de los doce que moja conmigo en el plato.", "words": [[0, 165315], [2, 165510], [5, 165650], [18, 166410], [22, 166590], [28, 167286], [31, 167626], [35, 168006], [38, 168206], [42, 168366], [47, 168826], [51, 169026], [56, 169486], [64, 170106], [67, 170226], [70, 170366]]}, {"verse": 21, "start": 171298, "end": 183572, "text": "A la verdad el Hijo del hombre va, como está de él escrito; pero ¡ay de aquel hombre por quien el Hijo del hombre es entregado! bueno le fuera a aquel hombre si nunca hubiera nacido.", "words": [[0, 171298], [2, 171518], [5, 171618], [12, 171958], [15, 172378], [20, 172658], [24, 172798], [31, 173118], [35, 173678], [40, 173958], [45, 174198], [48, 174378], [51, 174538], [60, 175429], [65, 175748], [69, 176100], [72, 176260], [78, 176540], [85, 176800], [89, 177140], [95, 177480], [98, 177960], [103, 178280], [107, 178440], [114, 178780], [117, 179060], [128, 180163], [134, 180490], [137, 180570], [143, 180770], [145, 181130], [151, 181450], [158, 181710], [161, 181970], [167, 182390], [175, 182950]]}, {"verse": 22, "start": 183922, "end": 193080, "text": "Y estando ellos comiendo, tomó Jesús pan, y bendiciendo, partió y les dio, y dijo: Tomad, esto es mi cuerpo.", "words": [[0, 183922], [2, 184059], [10, 184619], [16, 184859], [26, 185799], [31, 186239], [37, 186479], [42, 186999], [44, 187539], [57, 188939], [64, 189639], [66, 189899], [70, 190079], [75, 190419], [77, 190654], [83, 191687], [90, 192067], [95, 192247], [98, 192387], [101, 192487]]}, {"verse": 23, "start": 193430, "end": 199642, "text": "Y tomando la copa, habiendo dado gracias, les dio: y todos bebieron de ella.", "words": [[0, 193430], [2, 193529], [10, 193969], [13, 194149], [19, 195029], [28, 195569], [33, 195809], [42, 196349], [46, 196969], [51, 197619], [53, 197799], [59, 198119], [68, 198919], [71, 199179]]}, {"verse": 24, "start": 199992, "end": 205865, "text": "Y les dice: Esto es mi sangre del nuevo pacto, que por muchos es derramada.", "words": [[0, 199992], [2, 200102], [6, 200202], [12, 201236], [17, 201616], [20, 201796], [23, 201916], [30, 202316], [34, 202596], [40, 202836], [47, 203676], [51, 203896], [55, 204116], [62, 204516], [65, 204816]]}, {"verse": 25, "start": 206215, "end": 214210, "text": "De cierto os digo que no beberé más del fruto de la vid, hasta aquel día cuando lo beba nuevo en el reino de Dios.", "words": [[0, 206400], [3, 206620], [10, 206840], [13, 207040], [18, 207320], [22, 207560], [25, 207820], [32, 208320], [36, 208520], [40, 208760], [46, 209240], [49, 209400], [52, 209570], [57, 209740], [63, 210220], [69, 210700], [73, 210940], [80, 211200], [83, 211500], [88, 211780], [94, 212200], [97, 212580], [100, 212760], [106, 213380], [109, 213560]]}, {"verse": 26, "start": 214560, "end": 218746, "text": "Y después de cantar el himno, salieron al monte de los Olivos.", "words": [[0, 214560], [2, 214688], [10, 214988], [13, 215188], [20, 215668], [23, 215788], [30, 216168], [39, 216988], [42, 217328], [48, 217648], [51, 217888], [55, 218028]]}, {"verse": 27, "start": 219096, "end": 228894, "text": "Jesús entonces les dice: Todos me abandonaréis esta noche; porque escrito está: Heriré al pastor, y serán dispersadas las ovejas.", "words": [[0, 219096], [6, 219442], [15, 220022], [19, 220462], [25, 221286], [31, 221667], [34, 222127], [47, 222907], [52, 223167], [59, 223944], [66, 224231], [74, 224751], [80, 225753], [87, 225983], [90, 226103], [98, 226503], [100, 227023], [106, 227363], [118, 228103], [122, 228303]]}, {"verse": 28, "start": 229244, "end": 233680, "text": "Pero después que haya resucitado, iré delante de vosotros a Galilea.", "words": [[0, 229244], [5, 229391], [13, 229731], [17, 229911], [22, 230111], [34, 231051], [38, 231491], [46, 232111], [49, 232271], [58, 232751], [60, 232991]]}, {"verse": 29, "start": 234030, "end": 238080, "text": "Entonces Pedro le dijo: Aunque todos te abandonen, yo no.", "words": [[0, 234030], [9, 234556], [15, 235096], [18, 235376], [24, 236098], [31, 236315], [37, 236635], [40, 236835], [51, 237735], [54, 237835]]}, {"verse": 30, "start": 238360, "end": 247478, "text": "Y le dice Jesús: De cierto te digo que tú, hoy, en esta noche, antes que el gallo haya cantado dos veces, me negarás tres veces.", "words": [[0, 238360], [2, 238481], [5, 238621], [10, 238941], [17, 240000], [20, 240189], [27, 240509], [30, 240929], [35, 241289], [39, 241509], [43, 241769], [48, 242289], [51, 242489], [56, 242729], [63, 243309], [69, 243609], [73, 243809], [76, 243949], [82, 244289], [87, 244449], [95, 245049], [99, 245249], [106, 246009], [109, 246129], [117, 246589], [122, 246829]]}, {"verse": 31, "start": 247828, "end": 256099, "text": "Pero él con mayor insistencia decía: Si me es necesario morir contigo, no te negaré. También todos decían lo mismo.", "words": [[0, 247828], [5, 248068], [8, 248248], [12, 248468], [18, 248748], [30, 249668], [37, 250593], [40, 250753], [43, 250913], [46, 251053], [56, 251553], [62, 251993], [71, 253033], [74, 253213], [77, 253373], [85, 254164], [93, 254489], [99, 254829], [106, 255429], [109, 255569]]}, {"verse": 32, "start": 256449, "end": 264789, "text": "Y vienen al lugar que se llama Getsemaní, y dice a sus discípulos: Sentaos aquí, entre tanto que yo oro.", "words": [[0, 256449], [2, 256551], [9, 256831], [12, 257171], [18, 257551], [22, 257751], [25, 257931], [31, 258661], [42, 259391], [44, 259811], [49, 260171], [51, 260471], [55, 260691], [67, 262125], [75, 262405], [81, 263225], [87, 263465], [93, 263885], [97, 264085], [100, 264285]]}, {"verse": 33, "start": 265139, "end": 272098, "text": "Y toma consigo a Pedro y a Jacobo y a Juan, y comenzó a sentir temor y profunda angustia.", "words": [[0, 265139], [2, 265260], [7, 265540], [15, 266140], [17, 266440], [23, 266860], [25, 267100], [27, 267180], [34, 267820], [36, 268020], [38, 268080], [44, 268420], [46, 268885], [54, 269465], [56, 269525], [63, 269865], [69, 270425], [71, 270545], [80, 271145]]}, {"verse": 34, "start": 272448, "end": 277961, "text": "Y les dice: Está muy triste mi alma, hasta la muerte: quedaos aquí y velad.", "words": [[0, 272448], [2, 272559], [6, 272659], [12, 273520], [17, 273840], [21, 274060], [28, 274520], [31, 274740], [37, 275420], [43, 275660], [46, 275800], [54, 276397], [62, 276781], [67, 277081], [69, 277441]]}, {"verse": 35, "start": 278311, "end": 286166, "text": "Y yéndose un poco adelante, se postró en tierra, y oró que si fuese posible, pasase de él aquella hora.", "words": [[0, 278488], [2, 278702], [10, 278915], [13, 279075], [18, 279335], [28, 280415], [31, 280495], [38, 281055], [41, 281235], [49, 281695], [51, 282235], [55, 282575], [59, 282755], [62, 282855], [68, 283155], [77, 284255], [84, 284755], [87, 284975], [90, 285215], [98, 285655]]}, {"verse": 36, "start": 286516, "end": 293837, "text": "Y decía: Abba, Padre, todo te es posible; aparta de mí esta copa; pero no lo que yo quiero, sino lo que tú quieres.", "words": [[0, 286516], [2, 286642], [9, 287618], [15, 287768], [22, 288288], [27, 288428], [30, 288648], [33, 288748], [42, 290000], [49, 290300], [52, 290400], [55, 290724], [60, 291049], [66, 291533], [71, 291677], [74, 291877], [77, 292017], [81, 292157], [84, 292317], [92, 292677], [97, 292957], [100, 293157], [104, 293297], [107, 293477]]}, {"verse": 37, "start": 294187, "end": 302131, "text": "Y vino y los halló durmiendo; y dice a Pedro: ¿Simón, duermes? ¿No has podido velar una hora?", "words": [[0, 294287], [2, 294762], [7, 295397], [9, 295537], [13, 295717], [19, 296037], [30, 297128], [32, 297461], [37, 297721], [39, 297901], [46, 298713], [54, 299130], [63, 300091], [67, 300413], [71, 300553], [78, 300993], [84, 301393], [88, 301533]]}, {"verse": 38, "start": 302481, "end": 309402, "text": "Velad y orad, para que no entréis en tentación: el espíritu está dispuesto, pero la carne es débil.", "words": [[0, 302481], [6, 303047], [8, 303247], [14, 303587], [19, 303907], [23, 304067], [26, 304267], [34, 304767], [37, 304927], [48, 306036], [51, 306162], [60, 306682], [65, 306842], [76, 307722], [81, 307862], [84, 308022], [90, 308382], [93, 308862]]}, {"verse": 39, "start": 309752, "end": 313488, "text": "Y volviéndose a ir, oró, y dijo las mismas palabras.", "words": [[0, 309752], [2, 309875], [14, 310495], [16, 310655], [20, 310835], [25, 311435], [27, 311770], [32, 312070], [36, 312230], [43, 312630]]}, {"verse": 40, "start": 313838, "end": 321611, "text": "Y vuelto, los halló otra vez durmiendo, porque los ojos de ellos estaban cargados; y no sabían qué responderle.", "words": [[0, 313838], [2, 313974], [10, 314434], [14, 314594], [20, 315074], [25, 315354], [29, 315634], [40, 316514], [47, 316809], [51, 317029], [56, 317369], [59, 317569], [65, 317749], [73, 318169], [83, 319578], [85, 319683], [88, 319823], [95, 320263], [99, 320523]]}, {"verse": 41, "start": 321961, "end": 332333, "text": "Y vino la tercera vez, y les dice: Dormid ya y descansad: basta, la hora es venida; he aquí, el Hijo del hombre es entregado en manos de los pecadores.", "words": [[0, 321961], [2, 322079], [7, 322279], [10, 322459], [18, 322999], [23, 323179], [25, 323399], [29, 323559], [35, 324371], [42, 324950], [45, 325290], [47, 325963], [58, 326825], [65, 327328], [68, 327408], [73, 327588], [76, 327728], [84, 328566], [87, 328656], [93, 328936], [96, 329356], [101, 329616], [105, 329736], [112, 330116], [115, 330336], [125, 330996], [128, 331096], [134, 331356], [137, 331536], [141, 331636]]}, {"verse": 42, "start": 332683, "end": 336877, "text": "Levantaos, vamos: he aquí, el que me entrega está cerca.", "words": [[0, 332683], [11, 333582], [18, 334422], [21, 334502], [27, 334822], [30, 335262], [34, 335402], [37, 335542], [45, 336042], [50, 336182]]}, {"verse": 43, "start": 337227, "end": 351089, "text": "Y luego, aun hablando él, vino Judas, que era uno de los doce, y con él una multitud con espadas y palos, de parte de los principales sacerdotes, y de los escribas y de los ancianos.", "words": [[0, 337227], [2, 337370], [9, 337870], [13, 338030], [22, 338410], [26, 339210], [31, 339370], [38, 340370], [42, 340450], [46, 340630], [50, 340870], [53, 341030], [57, 341190], [63, 342110], [65, 342210], [69, 342410], [72, 342590], [76, 342910], [85, 343650], [89, 343910], [97, 344370], [99, 344570], [106, 345110], [109, 345430], [115, 345670], [118, 345930], [122, 346030], [134, 346810], [146, 348174], [148, 348295], [151, 348395], [155, 348555], [164, 349315], [166, 349815], [169, 349935], [173, 350095]]}, {"verse": 44, "start": 351439, "end": 359883, "text": "Y el que le entregaba les había dado una señal acordada, diciendo: Al que yo bese, aquel es: prendedle, y llevadle con seguridad.", "words": [[0, 351439], [2, 351566], [5, 351706], [9, 351846], [12, 352006], [22, 352666], [26, 352846], [32, 353166], [37, 353426], [41, 353646], [47, 354106], [57, 354726], [67, 355748], [70, 355868], [74, 355968], [77, 356248], [83, 356528], [89, 356988], [93, 357912], [104, 358212], [106, 358642], [115, 359072], [119, 359212]]}, {"verse": 45, "start": 360163, "end": 366954, "text": "Y cuando vino, se acercó luego a él, y le dice: Maestro, Maestro. Y le besó.", "words": [[0, 360163], [2, 360265], [9, 360485], [15, 360945], [18, 361300], [25, 361960], [31, 362300], [33, 362680], [37, 363000], [39, 363700], [42, 363840], [48, 364573], [57, 365173], [66, 366243], [68, 366407], [71, 366487]]}, {"verse": 46, "start": 367304, "end": 371096, "text": "Entonces ellos echaron en él sus manos, y le prendieron.", "words": [[0, 367304], [9, 367841], [15, 368381], [23, 369061], [26, 369241], [29, 369421], [33, 369561], [40, 369941], [42, 370181], [45, 370301]]}, {"verse": 47, "start": 371446, "end": 378628, "text": "Y uno de los que estaban allí, sacando la espada, hirió al siervo del sumo sacerdote, y le cortó la oreja.", "words": [[0, 371446], [2, 371587], [6, 371767], [9, 371907], [13, 372027], [17, 372167], [25, 372467], [31, 373067], [39, 373547], [42, 373707], [50, 374297], [56, 374887], [59, 375257], [66, 375627], [70, 375767], [75, 376207], [86, 376867], [88, 377267], [91, 377387], [97, 377847], [100, 377967]]}, {"verse": 48, "start": 378978, "end": 386150, "text": "Y respondiendo Jesús, les dijo: ¿Cómo contra un bandido habéis salido con espadas y con palos a tomarme?", "words": [[0, 378978], [2, 379103], [15, 379863], [22, 380223], [26, 380603], [32, 381353], [38, 381771], [45, 382211], [48, 382391], [56, 382951], [63, 383331], [70, 383751], [74, 383991], [82, 384511], [84, 384711], [88, 384911], [94, 385351], [96, 385471]]}, {"verse": 49, "start": 386500, "end": 394886, "text": "Cada día estaba con vosotros enseñando en el templo, y no me tomasteis; pero es así, para que se cumplan las Escrituras.", "words": [[0, 386500], [5, 386780], [9, 387120], [16, 387500], [20, 387800], [29, 388300], [39, 389140], [42, 389260], [45, 389400], [53, 390200], [55, 390340], [58, 390500], [61, 390640], [72, 391784], [77, 391946], [80, 392146], [85, 392446], [90, 392746], [94, 392906], [97, 393086], [105, 393666], [109, 393866]]}, {"verse": 50, "start": 395236, "end": 399138, "text": "Entonces dejándole todos sus discípulos, huyeron.", "words": [[0, 395236], [9, 396222], [19, 396962], [25, 397222], [29, 397542], [41, 398342]]}, {"verse": 51, "start": 399488, "end": 406693, "text": "Pero un joven le seguía cubierto de una sábana sobre el cuerpo desnudo; y los jóvenes le prendieron:", "words": [[0, 399488], [5, 399614], [8, 399754], [14, 400174], [17, 400334], [24, 400774], [33, 401334], [36, 401514], [40, 401654], [47, 402234], [53, 402794], [56, 403074], [63, 403474], [72, 404620], [74, 404729], [78, 404849], [86, 405349], [89, 405829]]}, {"verse": 52, "start": 407043, "end": 410893, "text": "Pero él, dejando la sábana, se huyó de ellos desnudo.", "words": [[0, 407043], [5, 407190], [9, 407590], [17, 407930], [20, 408110], [28, 409090], [31, 409250], [36, 409590], [39, 409750], [45, 410010]]}, {"verse": 53, "start": 411243, "end": 420610, "text": "Y trajeron a Jesús al sumo sacerdote; y se juntaron a él todos los principales sacerdotes y los ancianos y los escribas.", "words": [[0, 411243], [2, 411342], [11, 411942], [13, 412002], [19, 412342], [22, 412702], [27, 413202], [38, 414340], [40, 414600], [43, 414720], [52, 415440], [54, 415580], [57, 415760], [63, 416380], [67, 416740], [79, 417520], [90, 418380], [92, 418580], [96, 418760], [105, 419440], [107, 419600], [111, 419760]]}, {"verse": 54, "start": 420960, "end": 430891, "text": "Pero Pedro le siguió de lejos hasta dentro del patio del sumo sacerdote; y estaba sentado con los servidores, y calentándose al fuego.", "words": [[0, 420960], [5, 421125], [11, 421665], [14, 421945], [21, 422385], [24, 422485], [30, 423065], [36, 423525], [43, 423945], [47, 424245], [53, 424745], [57, 425185], [62, 425765], [73, 426887], [75, 426975], [82, 427295], [90, 427875], [94, 428055], [98, 428215], [110, 428815], [112, 429295], [125, 430155], [128, 430295]]}, {"verse": 55, "start": 431241, "end": 440088, "text": "Y los principales sacerdotes y todo el Consejo buscaban testimonio contra Jesús, para entregarle a la muerte; pero no lo hallaban.", "words": [[0, 431241], [2, 431339], [6, 431459], [18, 432279], [29, 433019], [31, 433219], [36, 433539], [39, 433739], [47, 434319], [56, 434819], [67, 435559], [74, 435879], [81, 436299], [86, 436994], [97, 437694], [99, 437774], [102, 437874], [110, 438811], [115, 438881], [118, 439001], [121, 439571]]}, {"verse": 56, "start": 440438, "end": 446500, "text": "Porque muchos decían falso testimonio contra él; pero sus testimonios no coincidían.", "words": [[0, 440438], [7, 440778], [14, 441058], [21, 441618], [27, 442118], [38, 442878], [45, 443198], [49, 443918], [54, 444318], [58, 444518], [70, 445218], [73, 445378]]}, {"verse": 57, "start": 446850, "end": 452888, "text": "Entonces levantándose unos, dieron falso testimonio contra él, diciendo:", "words": [[0, 446850], [9, 447774], [22, 448514], [28, 448894], [35, 449514], [41, 450074], [52, 450914], [59, 451254], [63, 451894]]}, {"verse": 58, "start": 453088, "end": 461358, "text": "Nosotros le hemos oído decir: Yo derribaré este templo hecho por manos humanas, y en tres días edificaré otro no hecho por manos humanas.", "words": [[0, 453088], [9, 453495], [12, 453675], [18, 453855], [23, 454215], [30, 454959], [33, 455059], [43, 455539], [48, 455779], [55, 456279], [61, 456479], [65, 456679], [71, 456919], [80, 457759], [82, 457899], [85, 458039], [90, 458279], [95, 458559], [105, 459359], [110, 459739], [113, 459979], [119, 460219], [123, 460419], [129, 460659]]}, {"verse": 59, "start": 461638, "end": 465445, "text": "Pero ni aun así coincidía el testimonio de ellos.", "words": [[0, 461638], [5, 461944], [8, 462284], [12, 462484], [16, 462844], [26, 463684], [29, 463844], [40, 464604], [43, 464744]]}, {"verse": 60, "start": 465795, "end": 475989, "text": "Entonces el sumo sacerdote, levantándose en medio, preguntó a Jesús, diciendo: ¿No respondes algo? ¿Qué atestiguan estos contra ti?", "words": [[0, 465795], [9, 466761], [12, 467284], [17, 467704], [28, 468524], [41, 469464], [44, 469664], [51, 470364], [60, 470844], [62, 470864], [69, 471164], [79, 472364], [83, 472584], [93, 473304], [99, 474072], [104, 474189], [115, 474889], [121, 475129], [128, 475589]]}, {"verse": 61, "start": 476269, "end": 484261, "text": "Pero él callaba, y nada respondía. El sumo sacerdote le volvió a preguntar, y le dice: ¿Eres tú el Cristo, el Hijo del Bendito?", "words": [[0, 476269], [5, 476431], [8, 476591], [17, 477091], [19, 477251], [24, 477431], [35, 478589], [38, 478714], [43, 479134], [53, 479714], [56, 479874], [63, 480254], [65, 480274], [76, 480854], [78, 480934], [81, 481034], [87, 481748], [93, 481988], [96, 482248], [99, 482408], [107, 483168], [110, 483248], [115, 483448], [119, 483883]]}, {"verse": 62, "start": 484541, "end": 494243, "text": "Y Jesús le dijo: Yo soy; y veréis al Hijo del hombre sentado a la derecha del poder de Dios, y viniendo en las nubes del cielo.", "words": [[0, 484541], [2, 484664], [8, 485044], [11, 485444], [17, 486191], [20, 486439], [25, 487298], [27, 487437], [34, 487877], [37, 488197], [42, 488517], [46, 488717], [53, 489177], [61, 489857], [63, 489997], [66, 490077], [74, 490517], [78, 490677], [84, 491057], [87, 491317], [93, 491657], [95, 492117], [104, 492677], [107, 492797], [111, 492937], [117, 493397], [121, 493557]]}, {"verse": 63, "start": 494593, "end": 501825, "text": "Entonces el sumo sacerdote, rasgando sus vestidos, dijo: ¿Qué más tenemos necesidad de testigos?", "words": [[0, 494593], [9, 495179], [12, 495479], [17, 495939], [28, 497059], [37, 497679], [41, 497939], [51, 498979], [57, 499643], [62, 499743], [66, 499983], [74, 500343], [84, 500983], [87, 501103]]}, {"verse": 64, "start": 502175, "end": 508673, "text": "Oído habéis la blasfemia: ¿qué os parece? Y ellos todos lo condenaron como merecedor de muerte.", "words": [[0, 502332], [5, 502527], [12, 502722], [15, 502917], [26, 503825], [31, 503925], [34, 504045], [42, 504845], [44, 504992], [50, 505252], [56, 505652], [59, 506032], [70, 506752], [75, 507052], [85, 507812], [88, 507952]]}, {"verse": 65, "start": 509023, "end": 519520, "text": "Y algunos comenzaron a escupir en él, y cubrir su rostro, y a darle bofetadas, y decirle: Profetiza. Y los servidores le herían de bofetadas.", "words": [[0, 509023], [2, 509110], [10, 509410], [21, 510090], [23, 510190], [31, 510670], [34, 510790], [38, 511010], [40, 511830], [47, 512250], [50, 512470], [58, 513030], [60, 513150], [62, 513340], [68, 513530], [79, 514210], [81, 514650], [90, 515543], [101, 516557], [103, 516663], [107, 516803], [118, 517483], [121, 517963], [128, 518363], [131, 518523]]}, {"verse": 66, "start": 519870, "end": 525619, "text": "Y estando Pedro abajo en el patio, vino una de las criadas del sumo sacerdote;", "words": [[0, 519870], [2, 520190], [10, 520510], [16, 520830], [22, 521170], [25, 521370], [28, 521490], [35, 522550], [40, 522910], [44, 523310], [47, 523450], [51, 523610], [59, 524090], [63, 524290], [68, 524730]]}, {"verse": 67, "start": 525969, "end": 532367, "text": "Y cuando vio a Pedro que se calentaba, mirándole, dice: Y tú con Jesús el nazareno estabas.", "words": [[0, 525969], [2, 526310], [9, 526530], [13, 526870], [15, 526950], [21, 527190], [25, 527410], [28, 527530], [39, 528370], [50, 528910], [56, 529728], [58, 529854], [61, 530094], [65, 530394], [71, 530794], [74, 531154], [83, 531694]]}, {"verse": 68, "start": 532647, "end": 539896, "text": "Pero él negó, diciendo: No conozco, ni sé lo que dices. Y se salió fuera a la entrada; y cantó el gallo.", "words": [[0, 532647], [5, 532815], [8, 533155], [14, 533715], [24, 534648], [27, 534773], [36, 535313], [39, 535453], [42, 535653], [45, 535773], [49, 535893], [56, 536553], [58, 536657], [61, 536777], [67, 537197], [73, 537317], [75, 537437], [78, 537777], [87, 538704], [89, 538851], [95, 539141], [98, 539431]]}, {"verse": 69, "start": 540246, "end": 546023, "text": "Y la criada viéndole otra vez, comenzó a decir a los que estaban allí: Este es de ellos.", "words": [[0, 540246], [2, 540426], [5, 540546], [12, 541006], [21, 541526], [26, 541746], [31, 542046], [39, 542726], [41, 542806], [47, 543186], [49, 543446], [53, 543566], [57, 543686], [65, 543986], [71, 544733], [76, 545058], [79, 545318], [82, 545518]]}, {"verse": 70, "start": 546303, "end": 559578, "text": "Pero él negó otra vez. Y poco después, los que estaban allí dijeron otra vez a Pedro: Verdaderamente tú eres de ellos; porque eres galileo, y tu manera de hablar es semejante a la de ellos.", "words": [[0, 546303], [5, 546467], [8, 546807], [13, 547267], [18, 547607], [23, 548415], [25, 548697], [30, 549037], [39, 549677], [43, 550097], [47, 550237], [55, 550557], [60, 550897], [68, 551777], [73, 552017], [77, 552317], [79, 552457], [86, 553184], [101, 553986], [104, 554266], [109, 554486], [112, 554666], [119, 555472], [126, 555709], [131, 555969], [140, 556669], [142, 557029], [145, 557149], [152, 557389], [155, 557609], [162, 557889], [165, 558209], [175, 558729], [177, 558829], [180, 558889], [183, 559029]]}, {"verse": 71, "start": 559858, "end": 564733, "text": "Y él comenzó a maldecir y a jurar: No conozco a este hombre de quien habláis.", "words": [[0, 559858], [2, 560024], [5, 560144], [13, 560764], [15, 560864], [24, 561484], [26, 561684], [28, 561764], [35, 562565], [38, 562711], [46, 563191], [48, 563271], [53, 563431], [60, 563711], [63, 563911], [69, 564071]]}, {"verse": 72, "start": 565013, "end": 578106, "text": "Y el gallo cantó la segunda vez: y Pedro se acordó de las palabras que Jesús le había dicho: Antes que el gallo cante dos veces, me negarás tres veces. Y pensando en esto, lloraba.", "words": [[0, 565013], [2, 565118], [5, 565258], [11, 565598], [17, 566038], [20, 566158], [28, 566518], [33, 567343], [35, 567488], [41, 567928], [44, 568408], [51, 568948], [54, 569028], [58, 569168], [67, 569568], [71, 569808], [77, 570128], [80, 570488], [86, 570688], [93, 571451], [99, 571775], [103, 571955], [106, 572075], [112, 572415], [118, 572775], [122, 572915], [129, 573595], [132, 573775], [140, 574195], [145, 574395], [152, 575366], [154, 575489], [163, 575909], [166, 576169], [172, 577189]]}]}